{"video_id": "Io5UFJlEJKc", "channel_id": "UC7c3Kb6jYCRj4JOHHZTxKsQ", "fetched_at": "2026-11-17T19:11:49.047635+00:00", "fetch_tool": "yt-dlp 2026.08.19", "caption_track_type": "creator_uploaded", "segments": [{"start_seconds": 0.29, "end_seconds": 0.75, "text": "<b>Good morning, good</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 0.75, "end_seconds": 1.62, "text": "<b>afternoon, good evening,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1.92, "end_seconds": 2.62, "text": "<b>depending on where in</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 2.62, "end_seconds": 3.67, "text": "<b>the world you happen to be.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 3.67, "end_seconds": 5.21, "text": "<b>This is 15 minutes to merge.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 5.42, "end_seconds": 7.08, "text": "<b>The show where we bring on some really,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 7.08, "end_seconds": 8.5, "text": "<b>really smart people to</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 8.5, "end_seconds": 10.17, "text": "<b>help you get unstuck,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 10.46, "end_seconds": 13.04, "text": "<b>to help you figure out how to take your</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 13.04, "end_seconds": 14.79, "text": "<b>DevOps to the next level.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 15.29, "end_seconds": 17.08, "text": "<b>One of the biggest challenges that I</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 17.08, "end_seconds": 18.46, "text": "<b>think we face when it</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 18.46, "end_seconds": 20.0, "text": "<b>comes time to set up</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 20.0, "end_seconds": 21.46, "text": "<b>our CD, to set up our</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 21.46, "end_seconds": 22.96, "text": "<b>continuous deployment is</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 23.0, "end_seconds": 24.71, "text": "<b>managing authentication,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 25.08, "end_seconds": 26.0, "text": "<b>managing authorization.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 26.88, "end_seconds": 28.58, "text": "<b>Sometimes we do this in ways</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 28.58, "end_seconds": 29.92, "text": "<b>that we probably shouldn't,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 30.12, "end_seconds": 31.38, "text": "<b>which is storing like</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 31.38, "end_seconds": 32.5, "text": "<b>usernames and passwords.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 32.96, "end_seconds": 35.17, "text": "<b>Sometimes we maybe go one step further,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 35.46, "end_seconds": 37.5, "text": "<b>we'll go with a personal access token,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 37.71, "end_seconds": 39.75, "text": "<b>but that also has its own challenges.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 40.5, "end_seconds": 41.92, "text": "<b>We probably all have heard</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 41.92, "end_seconds": 44.12, "text": "<b>about this thing called OIDC,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 44.12, "end_seconds": 45.71, "text": "<b>and it's related to OpenID,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 46.0, "end_seconds": 46.75, "text": "<b>and we know that we</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 46.75, "end_seconds": 48.21, "text": "<b>probably should be doing that.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 48.67, "end_seconds": 49.25, "text": "<b>But if you're anything</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 49.25, "end_seconds": 50.71, "text": "<b>like me and I know I am,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 51.25, "end_seconds": 52.96, "text": "<b>that whole thing scares you.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 53.38, "end_seconds": 54.25, "text": "<b>Fortunately, it</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 54.25, "end_seconds": 55.79, "text": "<b>doesn't have to scare you.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 55.88, "end_seconds": 58.5, "text": "<b>Mike Stemley is actually here to help</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 58.5, "end_seconds": 60.5, "text": "<b>walk us through all of this.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 60.92, "end_seconds": 62.33, "text": "<b>Mike, thank you very much for joining.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 64.25, "end_seconds": 65.08, "text": "<b>Thanks for having me.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 65.71, "end_seconds": 67.08, "text": "<b>Mike, tell me a little bit about yourself</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 67.08, "end_seconds": 68.88, "text": "<b>before we get in and talk about</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 68.92, "end_seconds": 71.25, "text": "<b>OIDC and how all this works.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 72.96, "end_seconds": 75.54, "text": "<b>Sure. As you said, my</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 75.54, "end_seconds": 76.29, "text": "<b>name is Mike Stemley.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 76.83, "end_seconds": 79.17, "text": "<b>I'm a Principal Architect at ArcXP.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 80.38, "end_seconds": 82.96, "text": "<b>One of the most important roles in my job</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 82.96, "end_seconds": 84.75, "text": "<b>is to keep my people safe,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 85.62, "end_seconds": 87.08, "text": "<b>and productive in</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 87.08, "end_seconds": 88.29, "text": "<b>production and at scale.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 90.0, "end_seconds": 93.62, "text": "<b>And as you said, one of the biggest risk</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 93.62, "end_seconds": 95.04, "text": "<b>factors there are people</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 95.71, "end_seconds": 98.42, "text": "<b>who are doing their</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 98.42, "end_seconds": 99.5, "text": "<b>best to get stuff done</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 99.79, "end_seconds": 102.0, "text": "<b>and are making choices</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 102.0, "end_seconds": 105.08, "text": "<b>that carry risk with them.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 105.79, "end_seconds": 109.75, "text": "<b>And this is all well-intentioned, but the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 109.75, "end_seconds": 110.71, "text": "<b>risk is there nonetheless.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 111.79, "end_seconds": 115.12, "text": "<b>OIDC is a standards-based way of</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 115.12, "end_seconds": 116.21, "text": "<b>delegating authentication</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 116.79, "end_seconds": 118.83, "text": "<b>from one system to another system.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 119.46, "end_seconds": 119.67, "text": "<b>Think...</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 121.54, "end_seconds": 124.92, "text": "<b>So we're all used to things like OAuth</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 124.92, "end_seconds": 127.38, "text": "<b>for authenticate with Facebook,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 127.62, "end_seconds": 129.17, "text": "<b>sign in with Apple, things like that.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 129.79, "end_seconds": 133.38, "text": "<b>Those are things where that system is</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 133.38, "end_seconds": 134.96, "text": "<b>allowing you to act on your own</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 134.96, "end_seconds": 135.42, "text": "<b>behalf and</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 135.42, "end_seconds": 136.92, "text": "<b>authenticate into another system.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 137.67, "end_seconds": 140.17, "text": "<b>OIDC allows you to have something</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 140.17, "end_seconds": 142.67, "text": "<b>asynchronously act on your behalf</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 143.33, "end_seconds": 145.46, "text": "<b>when you're not there in a</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 145.46, "end_seconds": 146.92, "text": "<b>non-interactive way.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 147.54, "end_seconds": 149.42, "text": "<b>That is a gross oversimplification and</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 149.42, "end_seconds": 150.62, "text": "<b>there's a lot more to it.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 150.92, "end_seconds": 153.71, "text": "<b>But for the purposes of what we're going</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 153.71, "end_seconds": 154.5, "text": "<b>to talk about today,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 155.88, "end_seconds": 158.71, "text": "<b>the purpose of OIDC is to delegate</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 158.71, "end_seconds": 160.58, "text": "<b>authentication from</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 160.58, "end_seconds": 162.12, "text": "<b>AWS to GitHub Actions.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 163.04, "end_seconds": 164.62, "text": "<b>So the first thing we're going to look at</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 164.62, "end_seconds": 168.92, "text": "<b>here is this really fun</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 168.92, "end_seconds": 170.04, "text": "<b>CloudFormation template.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 170.04, "end_seconds": 172.79, "text": "<b>And before anybody's head explodes, this</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 172.79, "end_seconds": 174.67, "text": "<b>is just basic CloudFormation.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 174.67, "end_seconds": 176.71, "text": "<b>There's nothing fun going on here other</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 176.71, "end_seconds": 177.67, "text": "<b>than CloudFormation.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 178.92, "end_seconds": 180.67, "text": "<b>The first thing I have here is the role.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 181.25, "end_seconds": 185.46, "text": "<b>You will see here that I have designated</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 185.46, "end_seconds": 189.08, "text": "<b>a federated identity provider right here.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 189.5, "end_seconds": 192.12, "text": "<b>And this is a URL that is specifically</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 192.12, "end_seconds": 194.33, "text": "<b>pointing at GitHub's</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 194.33, "end_seconds": 195.92, "text": "<b>OIDC provider itself.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 196.79, "end_seconds": 199.46, "text": "<b>This right here is the STS action that</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 199.46, "end_seconds": 200.12, "text": "<b>we're going to perform.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 200.46, "end_seconds": 201.25, "text": "<b>It's called Assume</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 201.25, "end_seconds": 202.12, "text": "<b>Role with Web Identity.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 203.58, "end_seconds": 205.38, "text": "<b>And then we've got conditions.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 206.08, "end_seconds": 210.62, "text": "<b>These conditions make it so that when STS</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 210.62, "end_seconds": 213.33, "text": "<b>receives the request and it's considering</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 213.58, "end_seconds": 215.21, "text": "<b>with the IAM policy whether or not you're</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 215.21, "end_seconds": 216.5, "text": "<b>allowed to actually make the request,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 217.21, "end_seconds": 218.88, "text": "<b>it's going to check the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 218.88, "end_seconds": 220.62, "text": "<b>claims on the OIDC token.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 221.75, "end_seconds": 222.42, "text": "<b>It's going to check the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 222.42, "end_seconds": 224.42, "text": "<b>sub, which is the subject.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 224.92, "end_seconds": 226.08, "text": "<b>So this is the data subject.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 226.08, "end_seconds": 228.17, "text": "<b>This is the entity that</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 228.17, "end_seconds": 229.21, "text": "<b>is making the request.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 230.29, "end_seconds": 232.29, "text": "<b>So it comes in from GitHub in the form of</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 232.29, "end_seconds": 236.92, "text": "<b>the repository colon, the owner slash,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 236.92, "end_seconds": 238.0, "text": "<b>then the repository name.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 238.38, "end_seconds": 239.17, "text": "<b>And there's a lot more</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 239.17, "end_seconds": 240.04, "text": "<b>that you can do here.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 240.96, "end_seconds": 242.54, "text": "<b>I've opened this up to just any</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 242.54, "end_seconds": 244.67, "text": "<b>repository under my own account.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 246.62, "end_seconds": 248.29, "text": "<b>And I've got the audience.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 248.58, "end_seconds": 250.25, "text": "<b>The audience right here is STS.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 250.5, "end_seconds": 252.62, "text": "<b>The audience is the entity</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 252.62, "end_seconds": 254.25, "text": "<b>to whom we are authenticating.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 254.67, "end_seconds": 257.62, "text": "<b>So we are authenticating to STS and we</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 257.62, "end_seconds": 258.83, "text": "<b>are authenticating from</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 258.83, "end_seconds": 260.58, "text": "<b>this repository running</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 260.58, "end_seconds": 261.67, "text": "<b>inside of GitHub Actions.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 262.46, "end_seconds": 265.5, "text": "<b>It is super important to make sure that</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 265.5, "end_seconds": 266.58, "text": "<b>both of these in here,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 267.0, "end_seconds": 269.21, "text": "<b>especially if you forget</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 269.21, "end_seconds": 271.08, "text": "<b>to put a sub in here or it's not</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 271.08, "end_seconds": 272.96, "text": "<b>restrictive enough, you</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 272.96, "end_seconds": 274.42, "text": "<b>could potentially allow anybody</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 274.58, "end_seconds": 278.08, "text": "<b>with any GitHub repository or</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 278.08, "end_seconds": 280.54, "text": "<b>organization to access your AWS account.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 281.0, "end_seconds": 282.71, "text": "<b>What's nice is AWS has recently put</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 282.71, "end_seconds": 284.04, "text": "<b>safety checks in here to</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 284.04, "end_seconds": 285.42, "text": "<b>make sure that these types</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 286.88, "end_seconds": 289.62, "text": "<b>of resources, the OIDC providers have</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 289.62, "end_seconds": 290.46, "text": "<b>these checks and</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 290.46, "end_seconds": 291.54, "text": "<b>these conditions in here.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 292.62, "end_seconds": 294.71, "text": "<b>I don't know how robust those checks are,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 294.71, "end_seconds": 295.38, "text": "<b>but they weren't</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 295.38, "end_seconds": 296.25, "text": "<b>there before and they are</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 296.25, "end_seconds": 297.17, "text": "<b>there now and that's great.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 297.88, "end_seconds": 298.33, "text": "<b>That's good to hear.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 298.92, "end_seconds": 300.62, "text": "<b>Okay, so in a nutshell, what you're doing</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 300.62, "end_seconds": 302.83, "text": "<b>there is you're</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 302.83, "end_seconds": 306.79, "text": "<b>specifying, okay, this call</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 306.79, "end_seconds": 310.0, "text": "<b>is going to be coming from GitHub, that</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 310.0, "end_seconds": 310.88, "text": "<b>it's going to be coming</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 310.88, "end_seconds": 311.96, "text": "<b>from, in this case, any</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 311.96, "end_seconds": 314.62, "text": "<b>repository under your organization, which</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 314.62, "end_seconds": 315.88, "text": "<b>is Manchicken, and</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 315.88, "end_seconds": 316.67, "text": "<b>that you're going to be</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 316.67, "end_seconds": 319.71, "text": "<b>authenticating against the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 319.71, "end_seconds": 321.75, "text": "<b>Amazon Web Services or AWS.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 322.08, "end_seconds": 322.29, "text": "<b>Yes.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 322.67, "end_seconds": 322.88, "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 323.33, "end_seconds": 323.5, "text": "<b>Yeah.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 323.75, "end_seconds": 323.96, "text": "<b>Yep.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 324.12, "end_seconds": 324.33, "text": "<b>Yep.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 324.46, "end_seconds": 324.83, "text": "<b>This is the...</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 328.0, "end_seconds": 330.12, "text": "<b>This is the call, which call is being</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 330.12, "end_seconds": 331.67, "text": "<b>made, and then these</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 331.67, "end_seconds": 333.04, "text": "<b>are the conditions saying,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 333.96, "end_seconds": 336.5, "text": "<b>check to make sure these things are true</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 336.5, "end_seconds": 338.62, "text": "<b>before allowing this role to be assumed.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 338.62, "end_seconds": 338.92, "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 339.46, "end_seconds": 339.67, "text": "<b>Perfect.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 341.54, "end_seconds": 342.67, "text": "<b>Then we go on to the policies.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 343.04, "end_seconds": 346.12, "text": "<b>This is usually where a lot of folks</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 346.12, "end_seconds": 347.04, "text": "<b>start to get bored because</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 347.04, "end_seconds": 348.71, "text": "<b>this can get very tedious.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 349.79, "end_seconds": 351.29, "text": "<b>Most important thing to remember here,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 351.96, "end_seconds": 353.38, "text": "<b>the only time I ever</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 353.38, "end_seconds": 356.83, "text": "<b>try to use a star is when</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 357.04, "end_seconds": 360.42, "text": "<b>I am using a pattern that is restrictive</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 360.42, "end_seconds": 362.46, "text": "<b>or when I'm using a deny policy.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 362.96, "end_seconds": 365.42, "text": "<b>So the first thing I always do with the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 365.42, "end_seconds": 366.17, "text": "<b>role that I want people</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 366.17, "end_seconds": 368.71, "text": "<b>to assume with OIDC is</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 368.71, "end_seconds": 373.21, "text": "<b>I make a blanket deny for assume role.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 373.46, "end_seconds": 376.71, "text": "<b>What this does is it prevents GitHub</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 376.71, "end_seconds": 378.46, "text": "<b>actions from assuming any other role.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 378.96, "end_seconds": 380.96, "text": "<b>If you want to be able to allow GitHub</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 380.96, "end_seconds": 382.0, "text": "<b>actions to assume another</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 382.0, "end_seconds": 385.08, "text": "<b>role later, I am role chaining</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 385.12, "end_seconds": 386.33, "text": "<b>is a really common thing</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 386.33, "end_seconds": 388.0, "text": "<b>for people to do with OIDC.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 389.17, "end_seconds": 390.62, "text": "<b>You keep this in here, but then you would</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 390.62, "end_seconds": 392.46, "text": "<b>add below additional</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 392.46, "end_seconds": 393.96, "text": "<b>policies to permit whatever</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 393.96, "end_seconds": 395.58, "text": "<b>roles you want to be assumed later.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 396.04, "end_seconds": 398.12, "text": "<b>So this right here is just a great way of</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 398.12, "end_seconds": 399.88, "text": "<b>helping to prevent people from being able</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 399.88, "end_seconds": 401.33, "text": "<b>to change their own role</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 401.33, "end_seconds": 402.67, "text": "<b>once they're in GitHub actions.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 404.54, "end_seconds": 407.08, "text": "<b>Then because for the purpose of this</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 407.08, "end_seconds": 408.83, "text": "<b>demo, all we're doing is</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 408.83, "end_seconds": 410.42, "text": "<b>uploading a file to S3.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 411.29, "end_seconds": 413.38, "text": "<b>The only permission that I've granted</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 413.38, "end_seconds": 415.33, "text": "<b>GitHub actions here is to</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 415.33, "end_seconds": 417.25, "text": "<b>put an object into an S3</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 417.25, "end_seconds": 417.54, "text": "<b>bucket.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 419.46, "end_seconds": 419.67, "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 420.12, "end_seconds": 422.54, "text": "<b>So it looks like then that that works in</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 422.54, "end_seconds": 423.71, "text": "<b>a last write that</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 423.71, "end_seconds": 424.88, "text": "<b>you're first saying, \"Okay,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 424.88, "end_seconds": 425.67, "text": "<b>deny everything so you're</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 425.67, "end_seconds": 426.46, "text": "<b>not allowed to do anything.\"</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 426.79, "end_seconds": 428.0, "text": "<b>And then the next thing that you're going</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 428.0, "end_seconds": 428.54, "text": "<b>to do is you're going</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 428.54, "end_seconds": 429.42, "text": "<b>to say, \"But you can</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 429.42, "end_seconds": 430.79, "text": "<b>do this one thing.\"</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 430.79, "end_seconds": 432.17, "text": "<b>And so it looks like it's in a last</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 432.17, "end_seconds": 433.33, "text": "<b>write, taking everything</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 433.33, "end_seconds": 434.38, "text": "<b>away, and then I'm coming</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 434.38, "end_seconds": 435.58, "text": "<b>back and saying, \"Well, you can do this</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 435.58, "end_seconds": 437.62, "text": "<b>one little thing, which is that deploy.\"</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 438.83, "end_seconds": 439.04, "text": "<b>Yeah.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 439.58, "end_seconds": 441.21, "text": "<b>And keep in mind, the only thing I'm</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 441.21, "end_seconds": 442.25, "text": "<b>actually preventing anybody</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 442.25, "end_seconds": 443.33, "text": "<b>from doing here is assuming</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 443.38, "end_seconds": 444.67, "text": "<b>another role, right?</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 444.67, "end_seconds": 446.08, "text": "<b>Because this role is empty</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 446.08, "end_seconds": 447.71, "text": "<b>until I put policies into it.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 448.08, "end_seconds": 448.29, "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 448.58, "end_seconds": 450.83, "text": "<b>So yeah, but then the number one thing I</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 450.83, "end_seconds": 453.92, "text": "<b>do is I block assume role.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 454.62, "end_seconds": 454.92, "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 455.21, "end_seconds": 455.96, "text": "<b>That makes sense.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 458.08, "end_seconds": 458.79, "text": "<b>And then this right</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 458.79, "end_seconds": 460.25, "text": "<b>here is actually the...</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 461.08, "end_seconds": 462.46, "text": "<b>This is the beginning, middle, and the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 462.46, "end_seconds": 464.5, "text": "<b>end of the OIDC provider resource.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 465.92, "end_seconds": 468.62, "text": "<b>All it's doing is taking a list of the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 468.62, "end_seconds": 470.62, "text": "<b>client IDs, which is always STS.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 471.33, "end_seconds": 473.67, "text": "<b>These are thumbprint, which is public.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 474.0, "end_seconds": 474.88, "text": "<b>GitHub publishes this.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 475.92, "end_seconds": 477.04, "text": "<b>It's used to verify</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 477.04, "end_seconds": 478.33, "text": "<b>that GitHub is GitHub.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 478.92, "end_seconds": 480.96, "text": "<b>And then this is the URL that you're</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 480.96, "end_seconds": 483.25, "text": "<b>telling OIDC to use for verifications.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 484.92, "end_seconds": 485.71, "text": "<b>It's pretty straightforward.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 486.12, "end_seconds": 487.62, "text": "<b>If you're making one of these resources</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 487.62, "end_seconds": 488.96, "text": "<b>in the console, you</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 488.96, "end_seconds": 490.08, "text": "<b>actually don't need this.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 490.92, "end_seconds": 491.96, "text": "<b>But CloudFormation from...</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 492.42, "end_seconds": 493.79, "text": "<b>Or at least when I started doing all this</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 493.79, "end_seconds": 494.21, "text": "<b>research,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 495.21, "end_seconds": 496.75, "text": "<b>CloudFormation required you to put</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 496.75, "end_seconds": 498.58, "text": "<b>this thumbprint in here.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 498.96, "end_seconds": 500.38, "text": "<b>But it's pretty straightforward.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 500.38, "end_seconds": 501.62, "text": "<b>It's published in the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 501.62, "end_seconds": 502.54, "text": "<b>GitHub documentation.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 503.17, "end_seconds": 506.54, "text": "<b>And if you go into the AWS console, it</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 506.54, "end_seconds": 507.62, "text": "<b>shows you right there what it is.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 507.88, "end_seconds": 508.08, "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 508.5, "end_seconds": 509.75, "text": "<b>And where does that</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 509.75, "end_seconds": 512.0, "text": "<b>YAML file need to reside?</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 512.0, "end_seconds": 512.58, "text": "<b>Is that going to be</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 512.58, "end_seconds": 513.5, "text": "<b>part of your repository?</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 514.04, "end_seconds": 515.46, "text": "<b>Is that going to be inside of AWS?</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 515.75, "end_seconds": 516.5, "text": "<b>Where does that reside?</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 517.88, "end_seconds": 520.71, "text": "<b>So like any other CloudFormation</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 520.71, "end_seconds": 523.42, "text": "<b>templates, what you do is you go...</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 524.5, "end_seconds": 526.38, "text": "<b>A lot of people have elaborate ways of</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 526.38, "end_seconds": 527.38, "text": "<b>deploying CloudFormation</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 527.38, "end_seconds": 529.29, "text": "<b>for my own personal account</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 529.29, "end_seconds": 530.79, "text": "<b>since I'm not doing</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 530.79, "end_seconds": 532.25, "text": "<b>anything all that fancy with it.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 532.62, "end_seconds": 535.46, "text": "<b>What I normally do is I just save this to</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 535.46, "end_seconds": 536.17, "text": "<b>disk and then I</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 536.17, "end_seconds": 537.5, "text": "<b>manually deploy it using the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 537.5, "end_seconds": 538.04, "text": "<b>web console.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 538.75, "end_seconds": 540.33, "text": "<b>A lot of folks are using things like</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 540.33, "end_seconds": 542.67, "text": "<b>GitOps or they're using</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 542.67, "end_seconds": 544.46, "text": "<b>CodePipeline or something</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 544.54, "end_seconds": 545.71, "text": "<b>like that to pull from Git</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 545.71, "end_seconds": 547.17, "text": "<b>and then deploy that way.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 548.5, "end_seconds": 550.75, "text": "<b>For work, we have fancy setups for</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 550.75, "end_seconds": 552.46, "text": "<b>personal use, not so much.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 552.92, "end_seconds": 553.08, "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 553.79, "end_seconds": 554.04, "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 554.46, "end_seconds": 555.92, "text": "<b>But it doesn't need to reside in AWS.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 556.25, "end_seconds": 557.0, "text": "<b>That's where it needs to</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 557.0, "end_seconds": 558.21, "text": "<b>eventually get pushed out to.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 558.38, "end_seconds": 559.46, "text": "<b>Yes, it does need to</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 559.46, "end_seconds": 560.42, "text": "<b>make its way out to AWS.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 560.42, "end_seconds": 561.5, "text": "<b>Would you like me to show you what this</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 561.5, "end_seconds": 562.38, "text": "<b>looks like when deployed?</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 562.62, "end_seconds": 562.71, "text": "<b>Yeah.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 563.58, "end_seconds": 565.08, "text": "<b>Identity providers live under IAM.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 565.67, "end_seconds": 569.5, "text": "<b>And this right here is the OIDC, OpenID</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 569.5, "end_seconds": 571.42, "text": "<b>Connect provider that</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 571.42, "end_seconds": 572.21, "text": "<b>we've already deployed.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 572.21, "end_seconds": 572.92, "text": "<b>I already went into</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 572.92, "end_seconds": 574.29, "text": "<b>CloudFormation and deployed that.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 575.71, "end_seconds": 577.21, "text": "<b>And in here, you can</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 577.21, "end_seconds": 579.58, "text": "<b>actually see all of the fun bits.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 579.58, "end_seconds": 581.75, "text": "<b>This right here is the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 581.75, "end_seconds": 583.92, "text": "<b>ARN for the OIDC provider.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 585.54, "end_seconds": 589.21, "text": "<b>Then you've got the URL for the provider,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 589.21, "end_seconds": 590.17, "text": "<b>when it was created,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 590.46, "end_seconds": 592.17, "text": "<b>the type, the audiences</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 592.17, "end_seconds": 594.17, "text": "<b>are right here, and then the thumbprints.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 594.83, "end_seconds": 597.33, "text": "<b>And then right here, you can see this is</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 597.33, "end_seconds": 598.83, "text": "<b>the one that we submitted.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 601.08, "end_seconds": 602.5, "text": "<b>If you're in a larger organization, you'd</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 602.5, "end_seconds": 603.5, "text": "<b>probably have tags here.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 603.83, "end_seconds": 605.5, "text": "<b>There are likely other rules that people</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 605.5, "end_seconds": 606.75, "text": "<b>would want, but it doesn't</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 606.75, "end_seconds": 607.92, "text": "<b>have to be all that complicated</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 608.0, "end_seconds": 610.5, "text": "<b>for my personal setup.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 610.96, "end_seconds": 611.17, "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 611.5, "end_seconds": 614.58, "text": "<b>So that's basically then that YAML file.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 615.5, "end_seconds": 616.5, "text": "<b>There it is, but now just being</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 616.5, "end_seconds": 617.75, "text": "<b>represented in web form.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 618.75, "end_seconds": 619.08, "text": "<b>Exactly.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 619.46, "end_seconds": 619.67, "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 620.88, "end_seconds": 622.83, "text": "<b>And then we can go look at the role and</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 622.83, "end_seconds": 624.33, "text": "<b>we can start from the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 624.33, "end_seconds": 625.5, "text": "<b>trust relationships and</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 625.5, "end_seconds": 627.12, "text": "<b>we can see that we've got</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 627.12, "end_seconds": 629.5, "text": "<b>my federated ID, the action.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 629.88, "end_seconds": 634.62, "text": "<b>It's converted it to JSON from YAML, but</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 634.62, "end_seconds": 636.25, "text": "<b>it's all still here,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 636.25, "end_seconds": 638.62, "text": "<b>just like I left it on</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 638.62, "end_seconds": 639.38, "text": "<b>the trusted entities.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 640.21, "end_seconds": 641.42, "text": "<b>And then if we start expanding these</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 641.42, "end_seconds": 644.38, "text": "<b>policies, we can see that</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 644.38, "end_seconds": 646.38, "text": "<b>we have the safety policy,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 646.38, "end_seconds": 648.25, "text": "<b>which is just denying a sumerul.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 648.83, "end_seconds": 650.88, "text": "<b>And then we've got the actions policy,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 650.88, "end_seconds": 654.5, "text": "<b>which is allowing put on this bucket.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 655.17, "end_seconds": 656.04, "text": "<b>That makes sense.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 656.54, "end_seconds": 657.42, "text": "<b>I love the fact that it</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 657.42, "end_seconds": 659.42, "text": "<b>has said, \"Hey, here's YAML.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 659.54, "end_seconds": 660.12, "text": "<b>Let's start here.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 660.12, "end_seconds": 660.5, "text": "<b>Now we're going to</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 660.5, "end_seconds": 661.25, "text": "<b>convert this into JSON.\"</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 661.62, "end_seconds": 664.83, "text": "<b>We need another markup language.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 664.83, "end_seconds": 665.88, "text": "<b>I think that's what we need.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 666.54, "end_seconds": 666.92, "text": "<b>Well, yeah.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 666.92, "end_seconds": 668.62, "text": "<b>I mean, we can convert it to INI format</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 668.62, "end_seconds": 670.46, "text": "<b>or Toml or something like that.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 670.5, "end_seconds": 672.38, "text": "<b>Let's all go back to the RML.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 674.17, "end_seconds": 674.38, "text": "<b>Yeah.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 676.58, "end_seconds": 677.12, "text": "<b>So yeah.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 677.46, "end_seconds": 680.58, "text": "<b>And what's great about this is now I can</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 680.58, "end_seconds": 683.29, "text": "<b>go in and I can start making actions.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 684.25, "end_seconds": 685.38, "text": "<b>These actions are not</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 685.38, "end_seconds": 686.5, "text": "<b>terribly complicated.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 688.25, "end_seconds": 690.92, "text": "<b>If we go look at this, this GitHub action</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 690.92, "end_seconds": 692.75, "text": "<b>is just going in and</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 692.75, "end_seconds": 695.33, "text": "<b>running the AWS STS get</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 695.33, "end_seconds": 696.0, "text": "<b>caller identity.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 696.67, "end_seconds": 697.62, "text": "<b>This is actually one of my favorite</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 697.62, "end_seconds": 700.33, "text": "<b>things about using AWS</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 700.33, "end_seconds": 701.54, "text": "<b>inside of GitHub actions.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 702.25, "end_seconds": 703.88, "text": "<b>The AWS CLI is already there.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 705.08, "end_seconds": 709.92, "text": "<b>And if you use this AWS configure AWS</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 709.92, "end_seconds": 712.04, "text": "<b>credentials action that AWS</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 712.04, "end_seconds": 713.25, "text": "<b>puts out and it's licensed</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 713.42, "end_seconds": 715.38, "text": "<b>under MIT style license.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 716.62, "end_seconds": 717.46, "text": "<b>It's it.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 717.88, "end_seconds": 719.04, "text": "<b>Oh, no, there.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 719.54, "end_seconds": 720.38, "text": "<b>Oh, come on.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 721.83, "end_seconds": 722.42, "text": "<b>We've all been there.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 722.71, "end_seconds": 723.0, "text": "<b>There we go.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 724.67, "end_seconds": 724.92, "text": "<b>Yeah.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 725.21, "end_seconds": 727.62, "text": "<b>So AWS makes this easy</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 727.62, "end_seconds": 729.25, "text": "<b>because all you have.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 729.75, "end_seconds": 730.88, "text": "<b>So I'll kind of go through</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 730.88, "end_seconds": 732.08, "text": "<b>the anatomy of this real quick.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 732.58, "end_seconds": 733.67, "text": "<b>So like any other GitHub</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 733.67, "end_seconds": 734.96, "text": "<b>action, it needs to have a trigger.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 735.54, "end_seconds": 737.12, "text": "<b>And because this is for demo purposes,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 737.12, "end_seconds": 738.58, "text": "<b>all I've got is workflow dispatch.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 738.96, "end_seconds": 739.67, "text": "<b>So it's just going to be</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 739.67, "end_seconds": 741.38, "text": "<b>me manually running this.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 742.21, "end_seconds": 743.17, "text": "<b>I've got one job</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 743.17, "end_seconds": 745.04, "text": "<b>called get caller identity.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 745.62, "end_seconds": 747.0, "text": "<b>It runs on Ubuntu latest.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 748.88, "end_seconds": 749.83, "text": "<b>There are a couple things that are really</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 749.83, "end_seconds": 751.04, "text": "<b>important for the OIDC.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 751.29, "end_seconds": 752.21, "text": "<b>The first one is this.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 752.62, "end_seconds": 754.38, "text": "<b>You got to have ID token, right?</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 755.79, "end_seconds": 757.29, "text": "<b>If you don't have ID token, right, then</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 757.29, "end_seconds": 758.29, "text": "<b>the GitHub identity</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 758.29, "end_seconds": 759.67, "text": "<b>provider is not going to be</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 759.67, "end_seconds": 763.29, "text": "<b>able to write the token and the AWS, the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 763.29, "end_seconds": 764.92, "text": "<b>AWS credentials action</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 764.92, "end_seconds": 766.17, "text": "<b>won't be able to read the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 766.17, "end_seconds": 768.0, "text": "<b>JWT that GitHub gave you.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 768.5, "end_seconds": 770.12, "text": "<b>So you got to have that on here.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 770.38, "end_seconds": 771.92, "text": "<b>And of course you need contents read.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 772.75, "end_seconds": 774.46, "text": "<b>I'm pretty sure that's a default, but I'm</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 774.46, "end_seconds": 776.42, "text": "<b>always, I always like to be explicit with</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 776.42, "end_seconds": 777.0, "text": "<b>permissions.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 777.33, "end_seconds": 777.92, "text": "<b>I'm the same way.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 778.54, "end_seconds": 780.62, "text": "<b>And not only that, but you know, the, the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 780.62, "end_seconds": 783.0, "text": "<b>catch was just leaving a default alone is</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 783.08, "end_seconds": 785.38, "text": "<b>you're then requiring the reader later to</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 785.38, "end_seconds": 786.67, "text": "<b>remember what the defaults are.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 787.25, "end_seconds": 788.0, "text": "<b>If you type it out, then</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 788.0, "end_seconds": 788.67, "text": "<b>nobody has to remember.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 789.83, "end_seconds": 790.21, "text": "<b>Yep.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 790.96, "end_seconds": 791.25, "text": "<b>Yeah.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 791.25, "end_seconds": 792.79, "text": "<b>And if there's ever any changes with the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 792.79, "end_seconds": 793.96, "text": "<b>defaults are, they become breaking</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 793.96, "end_seconds": 794.75, "text": "<b>changes if you weren't</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 794.75, "end_seconds": 795.12, "text": "<b>explicit.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 795.54, "end_seconds": 795.75, "text": "<b>Exactly.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 797.62, "end_seconds": 801.17, "text": "<b>So this right here actually is AWS doing</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 801.17, "end_seconds": 802.38, "text": "<b>all of the hard work.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 802.38, "end_seconds": 804.21, "text": "<b>They're already doing all that back and</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 804.21, "end_seconds": 806.21, "text": "<b>forth between STS and</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 806.21, "end_seconds": 807.42, "text": "<b>GitHub actions for you.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 808.21, "end_seconds": 809.67, "text": "<b>So you don't even have to bother yourself</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 809.67, "end_seconds": 810.58, "text": "<b>with any of that stuff.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 811.46, "end_seconds": 813.67, "text": "<b>But anything that is below that in the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 813.67, "end_seconds": 815.79, "text": "<b>same set of steps now</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 815.79, "end_seconds": 818.5, "text": "<b>has a live AWS session.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 818.83, "end_seconds": 821.33, "text": "<b>So I can just run this AWS command now</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 821.33, "end_seconds": 824.46, "text": "<b>and it goes and we can run it.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 828.75, "end_seconds": 830.54, "text": "<b>It was successfully requested.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 831.62, "end_seconds": 832.5, "text": "<b>And here we go.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 832.5, "end_seconds": 833.29, "text": "<b>We can see it running.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 836.5, "end_seconds": 839.38, "text": "<b>And there you go.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 839.92, "end_seconds": 842.17, "text": "<b>You've got the caller identity.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 843.21, "end_seconds": 844.62, "text": "<b>You can see that I'm in here.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 844.62, "end_seconds": 848.0, "text": "<b>I'm in as this role with the session of</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 848.0, "end_seconds": 849.42, "text": "<b>GitHub actions, which is</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 849.42, "end_seconds": 850.46, "text": "<b>the default session name</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 850.58, "end_seconds": 852.38, "text": "<b>for that AWS module.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 853.04, "end_seconds": 853.25, "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 855.12, "end_seconds": 855.33, "text": "<b>Cool.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 855.62, "end_seconds": 858.08, "text": "<b>So that gives me an ID, but how do I</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 858.08, "end_seconds": 859.29, "text": "<b>actually do something with that?</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 859.29, "end_seconds": 861.08, "text": "<b>How do I actually say like deploy?</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 862.58, "end_seconds": 862.88, "text": "<b>Yeah.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 863.12, "end_seconds": 865.88, "text": "<b>So I have this other action over here,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 866.12, "end_seconds": 867.92, "text": "<b>which is pretty much</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 867.92, "end_seconds": 871.83, "text": "<b>the same from here up.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 872.62, "end_seconds": 875.96, "text": "<b>So I'm using this additional action</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 875.96, "end_seconds": 878.25, "text": "<b>called actions checkout.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 878.67, "end_seconds": 880.17, "text": "<b>And this just checks</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 880.17, "end_seconds": 881.75, "text": "<b>everything out into the working folder.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 882.62, "end_seconds": 885.04, "text": "<b>And then I am going in here and I'm</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 885.04, "end_seconds": 886.29, "text": "<b>running the configure</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 886.29, "end_seconds": 887.92, "text": "<b>AWS credentials again.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 890.58, "end_seconds": 893.12, "text": "<b>Then right here, I'm actually just using</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 893.12, "end_seconds": 896.83, "text": "<b>the AWS CLI again to copy</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 896.83, "end_seconds": 898.62, "text": "<b>this file up to a bucket.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 899.21, "end_seconds": 902.12, "text": "<b>If you were say building a React app and</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 902.12, "end_seconds": 903.12, "text": "<b>then pushing that up to</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 903.12, "end_seconds": 904.38, "text": "<b>S3, and then you were serving</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 904.38, "end_seconds": 908.92, "text": "<b>it with CloudFront, you could run your</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 908.92, "end_seconds": 910.46, "text": "<b>NPM build right here and</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 910.46, "end_seconds": 911.5, "text": "<b>then copy the dist folder</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 911.71, "end_seconds": 912.0, "text": "<b>up.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 913.04, "end_seconds": 914.33, "text": "<b>However you want to do it.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 914.33, "end_seconds": 916.04, "text": "<b>If you wanted to run a program, right?</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 916.04, "end_seconds": 917.67, "text": "<b>If you were working on your own deploy</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 917.67, "end_seconds": 918.42, "text": "<b>script and your own</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 918.42, "end_seconds": 920.08, "text": "<b>deploy script, use the AWS SDK,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 921.04, "end_seconds": 922.67, "text": "<b>you could do that here too, just as</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 922.67, "end_seconds": 924.5, "text": "<b>easily as you use the AWS CLI.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 927.96, "end_seconds": 932.42, "text": "<b>And then when we go</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 932.42, "end_seconds": 936.71, "text": "<b>here, oh, where did we go?</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 937.04, "end_seconds": 937.46, "text": "<b>There we are.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 938.21, "end_seconds": 942.33, "text": "<b>So if we run this workflow, so you can</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 942.33, "end_seconds": 943.92, "text": "<b>see we ran this earlier</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 943.92, "end_seconds": 948.17, "text": "<b>at 14 past the hour, it</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 948.17, "end_seconds": 950.62, "text": "<b>is now 41 past the hour.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 953.08, "end_seconds": 954.71, "text": "<b>So and these run pretty quick.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 956.04, "end_seconds": 958.0, "text": "<b>Once this runs, you can see it's just</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 958.0, "end_seconds": 960.71, "text": "<b>running AWS run all that fun stuff.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 962.12, "end_seconds": 964.04, "text": "<b>You can see that it uploaded the file.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 965.29, "end_seconds": 967.46, "text": "<b>And now if I hit the little refresh</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 967.46, "end_seconds": 969.46, "text": "<b>button here, you'll see</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 969.46, "end_seconds": 971.0, "text": "<b>that timestamp change to</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 971.0, "end_seconds": 971.96, "text": "<b>41 past the hour.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 973.5, "end_seconds": 973.83, "text": "<b>Okay.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 974.67, "end_seconds": 977.33, "text": "<b>That actually seemed approachable.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 977.58, "end_seconds": 981.42, "text": "<b>So you configured that initial OIDC auth,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 981.71, "end_seconds": 982.25, "text": "<b>set up the</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 982.25, "end_seconds": 983.75, "text": "<b>permissions, said, hey, this is</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 983.75, "end_seconds": 985.42, "text": "<b>the repository, or in your case, the set</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 985.42, "end_seconds": 986.62, "text": "<b>of repositories that I</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 986.62, "end_seconds": 988.38, "text": "<b>want to be able to perform</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 988.58, "end_seconds": 989.17, "text": "<b>these actions.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 989.67, "end_seconds": 992.25, "text": "<b>And then you went in, you configure that</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 992.25, "end_seconds": 995.0, "text": "<b>inside of your workflow.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 995.38, "end_seconds": 997.75, "text": "<b>And now you're able to perform all of</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 997.75, "end_seconds": 999.62, "text": "<b>those actions and do so in</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 999.62, "end_seconds": 1000.96, "text": "<b>a secure way, in a secure</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1000.96, "end_seconds": 1002.96, "text": "<b>mechanism where you're not storing</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1002.96, "end_seconds": 1004.42, "text": "<b>usernames, passwords, or</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1004.42, "end_seconds": 1005.71, "text": "<b>dealing with personal access</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1005.75, "end_seconds": 1006.29, "text": "<b>tokens.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1007.42, "end_seconds": 1007.75, "text": "<b>Exactly.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1008.17, "end_seconds": 1009.58, "text": "<b>Thank you so very much for joining.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1009.92, "end_seconds": 1011.21, "text": "<b>And if you are looking for more</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1011.21, "end_seconds": 1012.83, "text": "<b>information about how to dig</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1012.83, "end_seconds": 1014.58, "text": "<b>in with OIDC, you can check</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1014.58, "end_seconds": 1016.38, "text": "<b>the little links that we've been throwing</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1016.38, "end_seconds": 1018.38, "text": "<b>up on the screen here,</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1018.38, "end_seconds": 1019.12, "text": "<b>check the description</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1019.29, "end_seconds": 1020.17, "text": "<b>in the video below.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1020.5, "end_seconds": 1022.08, "text": "<b>If you have any additional questions or</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1022.08, "end_seconds": 1022.96, "text": "<b>anything else that you</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1022.96, "end_seconds": 1024.58, "text": "<b>want to see, definitely ask</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1024.58, "end_seconds": 1026.17, "text": "<b>that in the comments.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1026.54, "end_seconds": 1027.62, "text": "<b>Mike, thanks again for joining.</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1027.96, "end_seconds": 1030.08, "text": "<b>And everybody, thank you for tuning in to</b>"}, {"start_seconds": 1030.08, "end_seconds": 1031.04, "text": "<b>15 Minutes to Merge.</b>"}]}